    "lawCode": "Amd §5, Chap 672 of 1993",
    "lawSection": "Public Authorities",
    "memo": "BILL NUMBER:S5030\n\nTITLE OF BILL:\n\nAn act to amend chapter 672 of the laws of 1993, amending the public\nauthorities law relating to the construction and financing of\nfacilities for certain public libraries, in relation to the Queens\nBorough Public Library\n\nPURPOSE:\n\nRelates to correcting the name of the Queens Borough Public Library\n\nSUMMARY OF PROVISIONS:\n\nSubdivision 48 of section 5 of Chapter 672 of the Laws of 1993 is\namended\n\nJUSTIFICATION:\n\nThis is a Chapter amendment to Chapter 323 of the Laws of 2014 to\ncorrect. the name of the Queens Public Library to read as Queens\nBorough Public Library\n\nLEGISLATIVE HISTORY:\n\nNone\n\nFISCAL IMPLICATIONS:\n\nNone\n\nEFFECTIVE DATE:\n\nImmediately\n\n",
